message: "If you use this repository for reference, please cite it as internship research software."
type: software
title: "SDHCAL Particle Identification and Energy Reconstruction"
authors:
  - family-names: "IDIR"
    given-names: "Mohamed Yanis"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-12"
abstract: "Research software from an M2 internship on SDHCAL particle identification and energy reconstruction, combining ROOT/C++ shower-parameter extraction, BDT/MLP/GNN PID studies, ML energy regression, chi2/TMinuit reconstruction, and PID-energy coupling comparisons."
keywords:
  - "SDHCAL"
  - "semi-digital calorimetry"
  - "hadronic showers"
  - "particle identification"
  - "energy reconstruction"
  - "ROOT"
  - "machine learning"
